Notes for AI coding agents. This is a NanoForge <%= part %> app, written in JavaScript: ES modules,
typed with JSDoc and `jsconfig.json`. NanoForge is a game engine built on an entity component
system (ECS).
<% if (part === "client") { %>The game runs in the browser.<% } else { %>This app runs in Bun: it has no graphics, input or DOM.<% } %>
